contact=f'''<section class="page-hero plain"><div class="container">{eyebrow('LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR IDEAS')}<h1>Questions? We’re<br><span style="color:#098d9d">here to help.</span></h1><p>Have a question about the printer, supported paper or which everyday problem it might solve? Prepare a message for the HiTech team.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col" style="align-items:start"><div class="form-card"><h2 style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:11px">Create an enquiry</h2><p class="mb24">This preview prepares a message on your device. It does not send or save personal information to our servers.</p><form data-inquiry-form><div class="form-field"><label for="inq-name">Your name</label><input id="inq-name" type="text" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="70" autocomplete="name" placeholder="What should we call you?"></div><div class="form-field"><label for="inq-topic">What can we help with?</label><select id="inq-topic" name="topic" required><option value="Product questions">Product questions</option><option value="Paper compatibility">Paper compatibility</option><option value="Price and availability">Price and availability</option><option value="Order or delivery">Order or delivery</option><option value="Other enquiry">Other enquiry</option></select></div><div class="form-field"><label for="inq-message">Your question</label><textarea id="inq-message" name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="1600" placeholder="Tell us what you’d like to know..."></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Prepare & copy enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form><pre class="inquiry-output" data-inquiry-output hidden></pre></div><div class="support-list"><div class="support-item"><span class="pill">01 / EMAIL</span><h3>Business email</h3><p data-email>Official email will be added before launch.</p></div><div class="support-item"><span class="pill">02 / PHONE</span><h3>Call us</h3><p data-phone>Official number will be added before launch.</p></div><div class="support-item"><span class="pill">03 / WHATSAPP</span><h3>Prefer a quick conversation?</h3><p>WhatsApp will appear when the official business number is configured.</p><a data-whatsapp hidden class="btn btn-small btn-primary mt24" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WhatsApp ↗</a></div><div class="support-item"><span class="pill">HELP CENTER</span><h3>A quick answer might be waiting.</h3><p>Browse common printing, setup and buying questions.</p><a href="faq.html" class="card-link">View FAQs ↗</a></div></div></div></section>'''

